AndroidLibClashLite

The internal Android Go support was extracted from the cmfa-core module of
AsteriskMETA at commit 0506dbf0401742f25b1f9293a01d57066ed2225b. It derives from
Clash for Android / Clash Meta for Android. The public bindings now use gomobile;
the old handwritten JNI and Kotlin facade are not included. Existing copyright
and license notices are preserved.
Upstream wrapper: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/ClashMetaForAndroid (core module).

Mihomo is provided by the github.com/metacubex/mihomo Go module, pinned in
go.mod. Its source remains available from https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo.

